</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r5" x="0" y="190.8" textLength="207.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">4&#160;&#160;⚲&#160;Dork&#160;Builder</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r2" x="280.6" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">│</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r9" x="305" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">┃</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r5" x="329.4" y="190.8" textLength="890.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">or&#160;that&#160;you&#160;have&#160;a&#160;lawful&#160;purpose&#160;to&#160;research.&#160;Respect&#160;platform&#160;terms&#160;and</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r2" x="1268.8" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">│</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r5" x="1305.4" y="190.8" textLength="97.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">signals.</text><text class="terminal-572964209-r1" x="1708" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-572964209-line-7)">
